                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "While we must stop the flow of fentanyl that is ravaging communities in Philadelphia and across the state, we must also tackle the addiction crisis and help recovering addicts find dignity and self sufficiency. Yesterday I joined @PhillyMayor at Riverview Wellness Village to see firsthand how bold leadership is changing lives and helping recovering addicts find their way. By integrating housing, recovery, health, and workforce training, the Mayor and her team are helping set a new national standard for combatting the opioid crisis. I look forward supporting this initiative however I can and watching it help those who need it most.",
